        <mxCell id="N2nTVU4Ex5qT0vqb23A_-64" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;KPM V3 Package Format&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;The KPM v3 package format is designed to offer an efficient, fast to parse format for signed packages with the ability to perform differential upgrades.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- KPM packages should be self contained as a single file&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- KPM packages must be servable from static hosting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- KPM packages should allow for differential updates&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
